<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were not well tested, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers:   Select and Choice 2-3 1125-1175 lbs 110.00</p>
<p>Heifers:  Select and Choice 2-3 1075-1100 lbs 110.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wed: 700    Week to Date: 17,900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
